s the developer of Future Residence?"},{"id":9066,"answer":"<p>Future Residence by True Future Development offers a curated mix of 1-bedroom apartments, 1-bedroom units with private pools, and 2-bedroom + maid apartments, providing options for investors, couples, and families.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What unit types are available in Future Residence?"},{"id":9067,"answer":"<p>The project features a flexible 50/50 payment plan, including 15% booking, installments during construction, and 50% on completion, making Future Residence in Meydan Horizon an attractive choice for investors seeking easy entry and high future value.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Future Residence?"},{"id":9068,"answer":"<p>The expected handover for Future Residence is October 2027, offering buyers a clear and reliable project timeline.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the handover for Future Residence?"},{"id":9069,"answer":"<p>Yes. All units come fully furnished and enhanced with an integrated smart home system, providing residents with a move-in-ready living experience that blends comfort and technology.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Are the apartments in Future Residence furnished?"},{"id":9070,"answer":"<p>Residents of Future Residence Meydan enjoy access to multiple pools, gyms, mini golf, kids’ play areas, splash zones, BBQ areas, an outdoor cinema, yoga retreat, and lush landscaped outdoor spaces, all designed to support a vibrant, community-centered lifestyle.</p>","question":"What amenities are available in Future Residence?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Future_Residence_Meydan_Horizon_Smart_Luxury_Apartments_fc698d0bfd.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Future_Residence_Meydan_Horizon_Smart_Luxury_Apartments_fc698d0bfd.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/